<v Ira Glass>《美国生活》由国际公共广播电台发行。

00:57:30.580 --> 00:57:54.930
<v Ira Glass>[FUNDING CREDITS]
<v Ira Glass>[赞助商致谢]

00:57:54.930 --> 00:58:04.220
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia who begins every staff meeting with his weird diatribes about fictional child detectives.
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ的管理监督是托里·马拉蒂亚，他每次员工会议都以他对虚构儿童侦探的怪异长篇大论开头。

00:58:04.220 --> 00:58:07.030
<v Marcus Johnson>Rrrrr. Rrrrr. Harriet the Spy.
<v Marcus Johnson>呼。呼。《哈丽特间谍》。

00:58:07.030 --> 00:58:54.520
<v Ira Glass>Harriet the Spy , indeed. I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>确实是《哈丽特间谍》。我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

00:58:54.520 --> 00:58:59.520
<v Announcer>PRI. Public Radio International.
<v Announcer>PRI。国际公共广播电台。
